    "sub_name": "計畫分析方法",
    "sub_ename": "PLANNING METHODOLOGY",
    "describe_ch": "課程主要內容為：人口推估方法、產業經濟分析方法、Garin-Lowry模型、DRAM模型、公共設施配置方法、方案評估方法、迴歸分析方法。",
    "describe_eh": "Major topics of this course include population estimation methods, industry-economy analysis methods, Garin-Lowry model, DRAM model, location-allocation methods for public facilities, alternative evaluation and regression method.\r\n\r\n",
